# Plan-only retention inspection for a disposable snapshot root.
# Run this on the backup host: $root is the local destination directory where
# the completed snapshots actually live. A remote destination is not implied.
# This example never changes the filesystem and has no destructive command.
# A future apply operation will require explicit current and previous snapshot
# roles; it is not part of this example. `--plan` remains safe even when the
# root contains staging directories or symlinks.

root = environment YESH_RSYNC_ROOT
keep = environment YESH_RSYNC_KEEP

if exists $root:
    rsync retention plan in $root keep $keep
else:
    echo "snapshot root is missing"
    exit 2
